      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Updated September 24, 2026. Injury designations below reflect the Wednesday, September 23 availability report, not a final game-day ruling.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Photo: Chris Spears / GatorBait Media. Florida at Auburn, September 19, 2026.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "GAINESVILLE, Fla. — Florida carries a 3-0 record into its SEC home opener against Ole Miss with one name on Wednesday’s availability report: wide receiver Eric Singleton Jr. The senior remains questionable with an ankle injury, and his return is expected to be a game-time decision.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "The No. 21 Gators host No. 4 Ole Miss at 3:30 p.m. ET Saturday, September 26, at Ben Hill Griffin Stadium. ABC will televise the matchup. Florida beat Auburn 44-39 last week after opening the season with wins over Florida Atlantic and Campbell.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "HEADING",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Singleton still waiting",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "headingData": {
          "level": 2
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Singleton has not played since Florida’s first offensive possession against Florida Atlantic, when his ankle was rolled up on while blocking for Vernell Brown III. He missed the Campbell and Auburn games, although he participated in warmups at Jordan-Hare Stadium before being held out.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "“He will come back when he’s right,” coach Jon Sumrall said Monday, according to GatorsOnline.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Sumrall said Singleton had increased his work in practice and would have another opportunity to test the ankle before Saturday’s game. The decision will depend on how well he can move and cut, not simply on his willingness to play.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "The coach said Florida could have tried to push Singleton into the Auburn game but chose not to risk a longer setback. That distinction matters: questionable leaves open the possibility of a return; it is not confirmation that he will play.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Singleton transferred from Auburn after beginning his college career at Georgia Tech, where he worked with Florida offensive coordinator Buster Faulkner. His return would add another speed threat to a receiving group that has continued producing without him.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "“When we get him back, that’s a bonus for us,” Faulkner said, as reported by the Gainesville Sun.",
              "decorations": []
            }
          }
        ],
        "paragraphData": {}
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": []
      },
      {
        "type": "PARAGRAPH",
        "id": "",
        "nodes": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "Reporting: ",
              "decorations": []
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "GatorsOnline’s Wednesday availability update",
              "decorations": [
                {
                  "type": "LINK",
                  "linkData": {
                    "link": {
                      "url": "https://www.on3.com/teams/florida-gators/news/initial-availability-report-for-florida-gators-vs-ole-miss-rebels/",
                      "target": "BLANK"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": " and ",
              "decorations": []
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "id": "",
            "nodes": [],
            "textData": {
              "text": "the Gainesville Sun’s injury report",
              "decorations": [
                {
                  "type": "LINK",
                  "linkData": {
                    "link": {
                      "url": "https://www.aol.com/articles/florida-football-injury-wr-eric-010450000.html",
                      "target": "BLANK"
